      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "红色梦想，\n与在这个地方度过时光的马娘们，\n通过交流，加深了彼此的羁绊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8c32e0c66d8283bdd393f8bba6e77a139ab231b08c5065ba918de9c2d3f2a34e",
